{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_06CD50","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"你真的相信<R=CIA,COLDMAN>所说的“<R=和平行者计划,PEACE WALKER>”吗？","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=CIA,COLDMAN>\", \"<R=和平行者计划,PEACE WALKER>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":86,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"嗯，我相信过。……不，也许其实只是我想相信而已。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"什么意思？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"Coldman是这么说的：Peace Walker是实现真正核威慑、为了和平而存在的武器，也会成为稳定中美洲局势的压舱石……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":151,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"“你制造的核武器永远不会被使用，它会成为永远屹立的和平<R=象征,ICON>。”他这么说。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=象征,ICON>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":117,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"当他说实现这一切需要我的双足步行技术时，说实话，我很高兴。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"高兴？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"当然了。我一直被学界那帮人嘲笑。他们都说双足步行不现实、毫无意义。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":99,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"第一次有人认可我的研究……我怎么可能不高兴……而且。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"我当时想，这样我就能超越父亲。通过制造“为了和平的核武器”。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"但Coldman是真的打算发射核武。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":40,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"是啊。现在想想，这本来就是理所当然的。“无人系统能够发射核武”……如果不证明这一点，这个计划就不会被认可。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":159,"review_flag":""}]}